    "title": "Strive (ASST) Buys No Bitcoin Last Week, Holdings Stay at 43,404 BTC",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/strive-asst-no-bitcoin-purchases-holdings",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Strive-Expands-Bitcoin-Treasury-With-61.4-Million-Purchase-Holdings-Reach-14557-BTC.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/strive-asst-no-bitcoin-purchases-holdings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Strive (ASST) Buys No Bitcoin Last Week, Holdings Stay at 43,404 BTC</a></p>\n<p>Strive bought no bitcoin and sold no stock last week, leaving holdings at 43,404 BTC, its Monday 8-K shows. ASST shares traded near $15.55.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/strive-asst-no-bitcoin-purchases-holdings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Strive (ASST) Buys No Bitcoin Last Week, Holdings Stay at 43,404 BTC</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Strive-Expands-Bitcoin-Treasury-With-61.4-Million-Purchase-Holdings-Reach-14557-BTC.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/strive-asst-no-bitcoin-purchases-holdings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Strive (ASST) Buys No Bitcoin Last Week, Holdings Stay at 43,404 BTC</a></p>\n<p>Strive bought no bitcoin and sold no stock last week, leaving holdings at 43,404 BTC, its Monday 8-K shows. ASST shares traded near $15.55.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/strive-asst-no-bitcoin-purchases-holdings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Strive (ASST) Buys No Bitcoin Last Week, Holdings Stay at 43,404 BTC</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
