    "title": "Bitcoin Price Fades Near $61,000 as Stocks Soar on Huang’s Return",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-fades-61000-huang",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bitcoin-Price-Holds-Near-75800-After-Hot-October-Jobs-Report.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-fades-61000-huang\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Fades Near $61,000 as Stocks Soar on Huang&#8217;s Return</a></p>\n<p>The bitcoin price gave back its Nvidia-fueled spike above $64,000 on Monday afternoon, slipping near $61,000 while stocks and crypto shares held big gains.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-fades-61000-huang\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Fades Near $61,000 as Stocks Soar on Huang&#8217;s Return</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bitcoin-Price-Holds-Near-75800-After-Hot-October-Jobs-Report.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-fades-61000-huang\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Fades Near $61,000 as Stocks Soar on Huang&#8217;s Return</a></p>\n<p>The bitcoin price gave back its Nvidia-fueled spike above $64,000 on Monday afternoon, slipping near $61,000 while stocks and crypto shares held big gains.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-fades-61000-huang\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Fades Near $61,000 as Stocks Soar on Huang&#8217;s Return</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
