    "title": "Grant Cardone: Bitcoin to 5x – MSTR So Cheap “You Have to Buy it”",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/grant-cardone-bitcoin-to-5x-mstr-so-cheap-you-have-to-buy-it",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6VpzmMy5Jv8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6VpzmMy5Jv8/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/grant-cardone-bitcoin-to-5x-mstr-so-cheap-you-have-to-buy-it-6VpzmMy5Jv8.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/grant-cardone-bitcoin-to-5x-mstr-so-cheap-you-have-to-buy-it\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grant Cardone: Bitcoin to 5x &#8211; MSTR So Cheap “You Have to Buy it”</a></p>\n<p>Grant Cardone says Michael Saylor \"is hated, frankly, by the Bitcoin community that needs him,\" and predicts Saylor will be proven one of the smartest individual thinkers.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/grant-cardone-bitcoin-to-5x-mstr-so-cheap-you-have-to-buy-it\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grant Cardone: Bitcoin to 5x &#8211; MSTR So Cheap “You Have to Buy it”</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6VpzmMy5Jv8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6VpzmMy5Jv8/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/grant-cardone-bitcoin-to-5x-mstr-so-cheap-you-have-to-buy-it-6VpzmMy5Jv8.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/grant-cardone-bitcoin-to-5x-mstr-so-cheap-you-have-to-buy-it\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grant Cardone: Bitcoin to 5x &#8211; MSTR So Cheap “You Have to Buy it”</a></p>\n<p>Grant Cardone says Michael Saylor \"is hated, frankly, by the Bitcoin community that needs him,\" and predicts Saylor will be proven one of the smartest individual thinkers.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/grant-cardone-bitcoin-to-5x-mstr-so-cheap-you-have-to-buy-it\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grant Cardone: Bitcoin to 5x &#8211; MSTR So Cheap “You Have to Buy it”</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
